 $WGSCHR TOVC=0.06,TOVCO=0.06,XOVCO=0.4,LERI=0.003,LERO=0.003,CMOT=0.,
 DELTAY=1.3,XOVC=0.4,CLALPA(1)=0.1,0.1,CLMAX(1)=0.9,0.9,CLAMO=0.1$
